[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2635130847","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100841#issuecomment-2635130847","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100841","id":2635130847,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dEOff","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-04T21:37:12Z","updated_at":"2025-02-04T21:50:46Z","body":"I don't reproduce the issue on Fedora 41 with Emscripten 3.1.64 when building with `scons platform=web target=editor`.\n\nAre you sure that's the exact command you're using? The error has `bin/godot.web.editor.dev.wasm32.js` which implies you made a dev build (with `dev_build=yes`).\n\n*Edit:* I've also tried with `scons platform=web target=editor dev_build=yes` but still couldn't reproduce it.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2635130847/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2635162431","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100841#issuecomment-2635162431","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100841","id":2635162431,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dEWM_","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-04T21:56:08Z","updated_at":"2025-02-04T21:57:35Z","body":"How are you installing Emscripten?\n\nYour issue sounds similar to https://github.com/emscripten-core/emscripten/issues/22249 which was 3.1.63 being mistagged and leading to a broken release on homebrew. Apparently 3.1.64 didn't fully solve that problem either.\n\nSo overall it sounds you have a version mismatch between emcc and the version of binaryen it's compatible with.\n\nThe recommended/reliable way to setup Emscripten is through https://github.com/emscripten-core/emsdk\n```\n./emsdk install 3.1.64\n./emsdk activate 3.1.64\nsource emsdk_env.sh\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2635162431/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2635260263","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100841#issuecomment-2635260263","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100841","id":2635260263,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dEuFn","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-04T23:03:59Z","updated_at":"2025-02-04T23:03:59Z","body":"I installed Emscripten using emsdk (specifically, following the installation tutorial here: https://emscripten.org/docs/getting_started/downloads.html)\n\nRunning `emsdk list`, it appears that 3.1.64 is the installed/active version:\n```\n> emsdk list\n...\nAll recent (non-legacy) installable versions are:\n         3.1.74\n         3.1.74-asserts\n         3.1.73\n         3.1.73-asserts\n         ...\n         3.1.64    INSTALLED\n         ...\n         1.38.34\n         1.38.33\n...\n```\n\nRunning `emcc -v`, it also claims the version is 3.1.64:\n```\n> emcc -v\nemcc (Emscripten gcc/clang-like replacement + linker emulating GNU ld) 3.1.64 (a1fe3902bf73a3802eae0357d273d0e37ea79898)\nclang version 19.0.0git (https:/github.com/llvm/llvm-project 4d8e42ea6a89c73f90941fd1b6e899912e31dd34)\nTarget: wasm32-unknown-emscripten\nThread model: posix\nInstalledDir: /Users/malcolmanderson/emsdk/upstream/bin\n```\n\nI will try using the exact commands you provided for building Godot, and report back with their results!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2635260263/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2635269856","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100841#issuecomment-2635269856","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100841","id":2635269856,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dEwbg","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"Use