"id":3032500411,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc60wEi7","user":{"login":"CNicer","id":57952797,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3OTUyNzk3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57952797?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CNicer","html_url":"https://github.com/CNicer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CNicer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CNicer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CNicer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CNicer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CNicer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CNicer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CNicer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CNicer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CNicer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-03T14:32:52Z","updated_at":"2025-07-03T14:32:52Z","body":"> I can reproduce this on [80a3d20](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/80a3d205f1ad22e779a64921fb56d62b893881ae) with Fedora 42 and Emscripten 3.1.64 (after trying to build with 4.0.7). It works after a clean build, so it's a cache issue. It seems [#102676](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102676) didn't fully resolve it.\n\nI previously built using emsdk 4.0.10. Afterwards I want to build with 3.1.62.\nI ran `scons -c` and built using `scons platform=\"web\" target=\"template_release\" --cache-disable`, but it still doesn't work. It still stops with the error: \"Unknown option '--enable-bulk-memory-opt'\". Can u tell me how to completely clear the cache?\n\nGodot: 4.4.1-stable. ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3032500411/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"perform